			'care_text' => 'Consistent oral hygiene and professional dental care are important for maintaining crowns and bridges. Brush daily, clean carefully around the restoration, and use floss or recommended cleaning aids beneath a bridge. Avoid chewing very hard objects, and schedule regular examinations so our team can monitor the restoration, supporting teeth, gums, and bite.',
