			'heading' => 'Dental Implants in Markham, ON',
			'lead' => 'Dental implants offer a stable, natural-looking way to replace one or more missing teeth. An implant is placed in the jawbone to support a custom dental crown, bridge, or other suitable restoration. At The Dental Hauz, we carefully assess your oral health and discuss your options to create a personalized treatment plan focused on comfort, function, appearance, and long-term care.',
			'images' => array( 1878, 1880 ),
			'intro_boxes' => array(
				array( 'Replace Missing Teeth with Confidence', 'Missing teeth can affect chewing, speech, appearance, and the alignment of surrounding teeth. Dental implants are designed to provide dependable support without relying entirely on adjacent teeth. Once restored, an implant can look and function much like a natural tooth.' ),
				array( 'Treatment Planned Around Your Needs', 'Every implant journey begins with a detailed examination and appropriate diagnostic imaging. We evaluate your teeth, gums, bite, and available bone before discussing your suitability, treatment stages, expected healing, and restoration options in clear, straightforward language.' ),
			),
			'expect_eyebrow' => 'Stable, Personalized and Natural-Looking',
