				array( 'Personalized Planning', 'Your treatment plan considers the number and location of missing teeth, your overall oral health, restorative needs, and personal goals to support a functional and natural-looking result.' ),
				array( 'Implant Placement', 'The dental implant is carefully positioned in the jawbone. A healing period generally follows, allowing the implant to integrate and form a stable foundation for the planned dental restoration.' ),
				array( 'Final Restoration', 'Once the implant is ready, a custom crown, bridge, or other suitable restoration is attached. We carefully evaluate its shape, colour, fit, and bite for comfortable everyday function.' ),
