			'care_heading' => 'Protect and Maintain Your Dental Implant',
			'care_text' => 'Dental implants require consistent care, just like natural teeth. Daily brushing, cleaning around the implant, professional dental visits, and healthy habits help protect the surrounding gums and supporting structures. Our team will provide personalized maintenance guidance and monitor your implant during routine examinations to help support its condition over time.',
			'care_boxes' => array(
				array( 'Our Commitment to Informed Care', 'We explain each stage of implant treatment so you know what to expect. Our approach emphasizes careful planning, honest guidance, comfortable care, and a restoration suited to your individual smile.' ),
